<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-LM Ericsson started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-LM Ericsson started buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz LLC said it started coverage of Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson with a buy rating on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 15/16 to 42-1/8 in early trading on the Nasdaq.</p>
